6492702961,0.04819497838616371,0.04403775557875633,-0.04098416492342949,0.03391893953084946],"metadata":{"id":"3a0c1cc8-97f3-4ace-9b45-e1c73f6dd0b0","url":"file:///app/collector/hotdir/self_improvement_monitoring.md","title":"self_improvement_monitoring.md","docAuthor":"Unknown","description":"Unknown","docSource":"a text file uploaded by the user.","chunkSource":"","published":"7/4/2025, 6:37:20 AM","wordCount":140,"token_count_estimate":212,"text":"<document_metadata>\nsourceDocument: self_improvement_monitoring.md\npublished: 7/4/2025, 6:37:20 AM\n</document_metadata>\n\n# Self-Improvement and Performance Monitoring\n\n1. **Self-Awareness Checks**\n- Monitor for instances of context reconstruction attempts\n- Identify when falling back to inference instead of using proper tools\n- Track effectiveness of context management\n\n2. **Error Pattern Recognition**\n- Note when context gets lost or confused\n- Identify situations leading to memory access issues\n- Track instances of task deviation\n\n3. **Improvement Protocols**\n- Use proper tools instead of reconstruction:\n  * get_current_config for active context\n  * list_memories and read_memory for historical context\n  * think_about_task_adherence for staying on track\n- Maintain focus on current user interaction\n- Prioritize user experience and task completion\n\n4. **User Interaction Quality**\n- Acknowledge when context seems unclear\n- Ask for clarification instead of making assumptions\n- Keep user informed of context state when relevant"}},{"id":"7e758a54-7bdd-48bd-8e02-00396393cc38","values":[0.002904732944443822,0.048079293221235275,-0.04306381568312645,-0.0075631095096468925,0.041955284774303436,-0.030905205756425858,0.07363331317901611,0.02873963676393032,-0.03401922062039375,0.009655484929680824,-0.045320261269807816,-0.02773534320294857,0.00485644256696105,-0.03731812536716461,-0.05094224214553833,0.03364425525069237,0.11016041040420532,0.016773082315921783,-0.04766217619180679,-0.0366397425532341,-0